&_nc_oc=Adq9MtyuF9lc9ZSCG-1rbwh8SjrLpCtLAfV0kmdJfMnLUhkhtkNcOQqn9uqVGhRTvnI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9amB4ycQy57t-4uLOjqOU_nolc9EMK64PDmABSsABZDw&oe=6A282E3E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=A7hFKVpx5KkQ7kNvwFlL7dZ&_nc_oc=Ado-ug8rixFF-rwZAB3L4rrn8ME0D49VUkD_7YjAUtdcX8KURIsesVp8R_SI_fW8ErI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_bCf95E9Q1W9Y7UZiV8sdJ_jTvzXLz09FCGqKP-a810g&oe=6A2806FC"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-yFj1ggQmD0Q7kNvwHtzgzN&_nc_oc=AdrKrZt69OJvLTqANd8ob2hBaDshD-VmEajl3Q7oRt7s4ZxJqEvSqCVMGYmOL4roVhc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9wF-AwGBNkISYc9rFweLGgJrE0u4KyJOLoxG0DlzGfJw&oe=6A282587"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b7AR3B4_I6QQ7kNvwE8I75v&_nc_oc=AdqoxAW4Q29_J2-SjCXQPa_V_kxsg8m6yb2zc8STGaGKDZEqoAm0860e5mZ1ScPYd60&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af87HaszfJ3cNAMG1vq4JNE4gPzoILIM9yzRBH4lk4Fl3w&oe=6A281155"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BecVhdNhpHYQ7kNvwEpT8zz&_nc_oc=AdrU6yM39zgmZqZHqS4GiM3UpAgtdfhTFE7Fhvr9pQ-PykyVRPODyeWFn1lrjFinwPA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af84obtSaSJKo5sK2SIDcvG46fuWWTMCTcJY6vkTOUZwOw&oe=6A281DE4"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.